# Copy this file to ".env" (never commit .env) and fill in what you need.
#
# --- Supabase (optional) ---------------------------------------------------
# Leave these blank/commented to run in "local mode": data is saved in the
# browser only, no account needed. Fill both in to switch to the shared
# Supabase database (live sync across phones, tablets and PCs).
# Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Owner login -----------------------------------------------------------
# If left blank the app uses the temporary login: owner / 123 (and shows a hint
# on the sign-in form). Set your own values before sharing the site publicly.
# NOTE: these end up inside the built JavaScript, so this is a convenience
# gate, not real security. See README -> "Security notes".
VITE_OWNER_USERNAME=
VITE_OWNER_PASSWORD=
